    "Use your tested or configured zones. Zone 5 has no upper limit here. We don’t estimate zones from age, and Apple Health’s profile import doesn’t include Apple Watch zone settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Used in: AthleteHeartRateView.swift",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use your tested or configured zones. Zone 5 has no upper limit here. We don’t estimate zones from age, and Apple Health’s profile import doesn’t include Apple Watch zone settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usa tus zonas medidas o configuradas. La Zona 5 no tiene límite superior aquí. No estimamos zonas por edad y la importación de Salud de Apple no incluye los ajustes de zonas del Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use suas zonas testadas ou configuradas. A Zona 5 não tem limite superior aqui. Não estimamos zonas pela idade, e a importação do Saúde da Apple não inclui as zonas do Apple Watch."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez vos zones testées ou configurées. La Zone 5 n’a pas de limite supérieure ici. Nous n’estimons pas les zones à partir de l’âge, et l’importation de Santé d’Apple n’inclut pas les réglages de zones de l’Apple Watch."
          }
        }
      }
